course: dictionary
lesson: 15275
title: Silicates in rocks and sand
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: A silicate is a mineral or compound made of silicon and oxygen, often with metals too. Silicon and oxygen are the building blocks, and silicate is the name for the family they make.
explain: Most rocks, sand and clay are made of silicates. «The beach sand is made of tiny grains of silicate.» When you see silicate in a science text, ask: is the writer talking about a rock or mineral, or about a material made from one?
explain: The word can also name a material. «Some glass is made from silicates.» Here the silicate is the stuff used to make glass, cement and paint. The sentence around the word gives you the clue.
fact: A silicate is a mineral or compound made of silicon and oxygen.
fact: Most rocks, sand and clay are made of silicates.
fact: Quartz, feldspar and mica are silicate minerals found in the Earth's crust.
fact: «Some glass is made from silicates» shows that silicates are also used as a material.
fact: A silicate can be a mineral in the ground or a material made from these compounds.
exercise: «Most rocks, sand and clay are made of silicates.» What are most rocks, sand and clay made of? | Metals only | Water | Plastic | *Silicates
exercise: What two elements are silicates made of? | Hydrogen and carbon | Salt and water | Iron and gold | *Silicon and oxygen
exercise: «The mountain is made of quartz, feldspar and mica.» Which of these is NOT a silicate mineral? | Mica | *Water | Feldspar | Quartz
test: «The glass in the window is made from silicates.» In this sentence, what is a silicate? | A rock on a mountain | *A material used to make glass | A kind of animal | A type of plant
test: Which is the best meaning of silicate? | A living thing that lives in the sea | A type of sugar | *A mineral or compound made of silicon and oxygen, often with metals | A gas found in the air
exam: Which statement about silicates is true? | Silicates are made of gold | Silicates are only found in the sea | *Most rocks, sand and clay are made of silicates | Silicates are a kind of plant
